                                                "sense_id": "0d49a42a-9742-358e-b649-13454431a463",
                                                "text": "'Was that an echo?' said the Baronet, astonished at the sternutation which resounded from above; 'or' - drawing close to the adept, 'can it be the spirit you talked of, ridiculing our attempt upon his hidden treasures?'"
